(Mutual Non-Disclosure Agreement) Tj T*
T*
(This Mutual Non-Disclosure Agreement \(the "Agreement"\) is made on 3 March 2026) Tj T*
(\(the "Effective Date"\) between Northwind Analytics Private Limited, a company) Tj T*
(incorporated under the Companies Act, 2013, with its registered office at) Tj T*
(14 Residency Road, Bengaluru 560025 \("Northwind"\), and Lakeshore Health) Tj T*
(Services LLP, with its office at 221 FC Road, Pune 411004 \("Lakeshore"\).) Tj T*
T*
(Northwind and Lakeshore wish to evaluate a joint project on patient analytics) Tj T*
(\(the "Purpose"\) and, for that Purpose, may share confidential information.) Tj T*
T*
(1. Definitions) Tj T*
T*
("Confidential Information" means any business, technical or financial) Tj T*
(information disclosed by one party \(the "Disclosing Party"\) to the other) Tj T*
(\(the "Receiving Party"\), in writing, orally or electronically, that is marked) Tj T*
(confidential or would reasonably be understood to be confidential.) Tj T*
