(2. Obligations of the Receiving Party) Tj T*
T*
(The Receiving Party shall use Confidential Information only for the Purpose,) Tj T*
(shall not disclose it to any third party without prior written consent, and) Tj T*
(shall protect it with at least the same care it uses for its own confidential) Tj T*
(information, and in no case less than reasonable care. Access shall be limited) Tj T*
(to employees and advisers who need to know it and are bound by written duties) Tj T*
(of confidentiality at least as strict as those in this Agreement.) Tj T*
T*
(3. Exclusions) Tj T*
T*
(These obligations do not apply to information that: \(a\) is or becomes public) Tj T*
(through no fault of the Receiving Party; \(b\) was known to the Receiving Party) Tj T*
(before disclosure; \(c\) is independently developed without use of Confidential) Tj T*
(Information; or \(d\) must be disclosed by law or court order, provided the) Tj T*
(Receiving Party gives prompt written notice, where lawful, so the Disclosing) Tj T*
(Party may seek a protective order.) Tj T*
