(4. Term and Termination) Tj T*
T*
(This Agreement remains in force for 2 years from the Effective Date. Either) Tj T*
(party may terminate it by giving 30 days' written notice to the other party.) Tj T*
(The obligations in Clause 2 survive termination for a period of 3 years.) Tj T*
T*
(5. Return of Materials) Tj T*
T*
(Within 15 days of a written request or of termination, the Receiving Party) Tj T*
(shall return or destroy all Confidential Information and confirm in writing) Tj T*
(that it has done so.) Tj T*
T*
(6. Remedies) Tj T*
T*
(A breach of this Agreement may cause irreparable harm. In addition to any other) Tj T*
(remedy, the Disclosing Party may seek an injunction. The parties agree that) Tj T*
(liquidated damages of INR 10,00,000 \(Rupees Ten Lakh\) are a genuine pre-estimate) Tj T*
(of loss for each proven unauthorised disclosure.) Tj T*
