(7. Governing Law and Disputes) Tj T*
T*
(This Agreement is governed by the laws of India. Any dispute shall be referred) Tj T*
(to arbitration by a sole arbitrator under the Arbitration and Conciliation Act,) Tj T*
(1996. The seat of arbitration shall be Bengaluru, and the courts at Bengaluru) Tj T*
(shall have exclusive jurisdiction.) Tj T*
T*
(8. General) Tj T*
T*
(This Agreement is the entire agreement between the parties on its subject and) Tj T*
(may be amended only in writing signed by both parties.) Tj T*
